WEBVTT

00:03:59.947 --> 00:04:03.393
which was once as vibrant
as Caribbean cultures,

00:04:03.417 --> 00:04:05.448
as colorful as the architecture,

00:04:05.472 --> 00:04:07.339
and as bustling as carnival.

00:04:07.671 --> 00:04:09.369
Because of climate change,

00:04:09.393 --> 00:04:12.236
on top of overfishing and pollution,

00:04:12.260 --> 00:04:16.879
coral reefs may be gone within 30 years.

00:04:16.903 --> 00:04:19.827
An entire ecosystem erased.

00:04:20.188 --> 00:04:21.346
This is devastating,

00:04:21.370 --> 00:04:25.694
because hundreds of millions
of people around the world

00:04:25.718 --> 00:04:29.560
depend on reefs
for their nutrition and income.

00:04:29.584 --> 00:04:31.210
Let that sink in.